.TH GIAC-KERNEL 1 "November 2026" "giac-kernel 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
giac-kernel \- Jupyter kernel for the Giac computer algebra system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B giac-kernel
.I CONNECTION_FILE
.br
.B giac-kernel
.B \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B giac-kernel
runs Giac as a Jupyter kernel. It is not started by hand: a Jupyter client
such as
.BR jotter (1)
starts it through the kernelspec named
.B giac
and passes the path of a connection file, which names the ports and the
signing key to use.
.PP
Results are sent as plain text and as LaTeX; 2D graphics are sent as SVG.
Input ending in
.B :;
is evaluated without showing its result.
.B ?name
shows the help for a Giac command.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/jupyter/kernels/giac/kernel.json
The kernelspec clients use to find and start the kernel.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
jotter \-\-kernel giac
jotter notebook.ipynb
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jotter (1)
